# Line-ending normalization is on (core.autocrlf=true), and git decides text vs
# binary by sniffing. A reportlab PDF has long uncompressed stretches and gets
# sniffed as TEXT, which means checkout would rewrite its LF bytes to CRLF and
# corrupt the file. These types are declared rather than guessed.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico   binary
